A Buildroot Developer Day took place last month, on Friday 29th
October, right after the Embedded Linux Conference Europe. The people
who participated to the session are :

 * Peter Korsgaard
 * Lionel Landwerlin
 * Yann E. Morin
 * Nicolas Ferre (only the morning)
